This project was developed as coursework at the Department of Computing,
Imperial College London, to integrate with the department's Scientia platform.

The following files are adapted from, or generated against, code and APIs
maintained by the Department of Computing EdTech team. They are included so
the service runs in the same ecosystem, and are NOT covered by this
repository's MIT License:

  app/dev_service_providers/ldap_authentication.py
      Fake LDAP authenticator for local development (adapted from scientia-api).

  app/doc_upstream_services/base_service.py
  app/doc_upstream_services/response_wrappers.py
      HTTP client base class and response wrapper for upstream DoC services
      (adapted from scientia-api).

  app/doc_upstream_services/abc/schemas.py
      Pydantic models generated with datamodel-code-generator from the DoC
      ABC API's OpenAPI specification (scripts/autogenerate-abc-schemas.sh).

Other project scaffolding (dependency-injection layout, test fixtures,
migrations setup) follows the conventions of DoC EdTech services.
